## 1) What is Unleash?

Unleash is an open-source feature management platform designed for implementing feature toggles (feature flags) in applications. It allows developers to release new features to a subset of users, run A/B tests, and enable or disable functionality without redeploying code. This enables safer deployments, faster experimentation, and better control over production features.

**Key Use Cases:**

* Gradual rollouts
* Canary releases
* A/B testing
* Operational toggles (e.g., disabling heavy features during peak load)

